# demo_rect Specification

## Overview

`demo_rect` demonstrates rectangle detection and tracking using OpenCV.

## Usage

```bash
python demo_rect.py [options]
```

## Arguments

| Argument | Type | Default | Description |
|----------|------|---------|-------------|
| `--device` | int | 0 | Camera device index |

## Features

- Rectangle contour detection
- Real-time tracking
- Visual overlay of detected rectangles

## Exit

- Press ESC to quit
